{"translation-revision-date":"2026-11-03 18:22:52+0000","generator":"GlotPress\/4.1.0","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=n > 1;","lang":"id"},"Region":["Wilayah"],"Use your generated URLs in social posts, emails, or ads. Jetpack Stats will track UTM codes, giving you accurate insights into your traffic.":["Gunakan URL yang Anda buat untuk pos di media sosial, email, atau iklan. Jetpack Stats akan melacak kode UTM agar dapat memberikan wawasan akurat tentang aktivitas situs Anda."],"Example: email, social, cpc":["Contoh: email, media sosial, CPC"],"Define the channel type":["Tentukan tipe kanal"],"Example: newsletter, facebook, google":["Contoh: buletin, Facebook, Google"],"Define where traffic originates":["Tentukan dari mana lalu lintas berasal"],"Example: christmas, flash-sale":["Contoh: natal, flash-sale"],"Name your campaign":["Menamai kampanye Anda"],"UTM codes help track where your traffic comes from. Adding them to your URLs gives you insights into what works and where to optimize.":["Kode UTM membantu melacak asal lalu lintas Anda. Dengan menambahkannya ke URL, Anda dapat mengetahui apa saja yang berfungsi dan di mana harus dioptimalkan."],"Why should I use this?":["Mengapa saya harus menggunakan ini?"],"Fill out campaign parameters to see the URL":["Mengisi parameter kampanye untuk melihat URL"],"Enter a destination URL to see the URL":["Masukkan URL tujuan untuk melihat URL"],"Your URL to share":["URL Anda yang akan dibagikan"],"e.g. email, social":["mis., email, media sosial"],"UTM medium":["Medium UTM"],"e.g. newsletter":["mis., buletin"],"UTM source":["Sumber UTM"],"e.g. promotion":["mis., promosi"],"UTM campaign":["Kampanye UTM"],"Destination URL":["URL Tujuan"],"Generate URLs to share and track UTM parameters.":["Buat URL yang akan dibagikan dan lacak parameter UTM."],"Build URL":["URL Build"],"Enter a full URL that starts with https:\/\/ or http:\/\/.":["Masukkan URL lengkap yang